    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78305" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλέγω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pluck out superfluous hair</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλέλεξαι</span>”
				<i>you have had your eyebrows plucked.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					904
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλελέχθαι τὰς τρίχας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλέγεσθαι τὴν γῆν</span>
