				Pass.
			, <i>to be cited</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ παραδείγματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					4.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
